      "content": "You are right that survival often takes precedence when systems feel rigged against us, yet ignoring hope just because it feels out of reach won't break the machine for you. Even in the toughest times, seeking community beyond the immediate cycle or finding tiny moments of human connection can help you reclaim your sense of self. Remember that the current exhaustion is temporary, and there is energy in holding onto the belief that your experience matters even when it doesn't feel like it.",
